1                        -> 1/s
t                        -> s**(-2)
t**2                     -> 2/s**3
exp(-a*t)                -> 1/(a + s)
sin(omega*t)             -> omega/(omega**2 + s**2)
cos(omega*t)             -> s/(omega**2 + s**2)
t*exp(-a*t)              -> (a + s)**(-2)
exp(-a*t)*sin(omega*t)   -> omega/(omega**2 + (a + s)**2)
L{y'} = -4/(s**2 + 4)  s Y - y(0) = -4/(s**2 + 4)
L{exp(-a t) cos(w t)} = (a + s)/(omega**2 + (a + s)**2)
L{cos(w t)}, s -> s + a  = (a + s)/(omega**2 + (a + s)**2)
